   202	Sympy lines 54–56 vs Mathematica lines 58–60 — balance assertions:
   203	
   204	```
   205	# sympy
   206	expect_zero("r - sqrt(4107 - 100 pi^2)/(10 pi)", r - R / (10 * sp.pi))
   207	expect_zero("lower branch balance relation", 1 + r**2 - 4 * (gminus - r) ** 2)
   208	expect_zero("upper branch balance relation", 1 + r**2 - 4 * (gplus - r) ** 2)
